<title>USA: Positron Corp Q1 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Positron Corp Q1 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997	     1996</p>
<p> Revenue				$   622,000   $ 1,205,000</p>
<p> Gross profit (loss)		    475,000     (268,000) (a)</p>
<p> Net loss			     (1,354,000)   (2,077,000) (a)</p>
<p> Net loss per common share		(.30)	   (.55)</p>
<p> Weighted average common shares   4,473,566     3,637,320</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) Includes a non-recurring $1,000,000 provision for losses which may materialize on the upgrade of previously sold equipment.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 603-3310))</p>
